<%# The inside of a row, shared by every surface that lists kept or archived
    works. Locals: painting, pick (nil = no published Daily Pick — never was
    one, or no longer is; the two are indistinguishable and this renders the
    same either way), current, eager.

    The date slot renders nothing at all for a nil pick — story 0030 deleted
    "No longer a day" here, which was true only for the curator-removed case
    and false for the far more common one since `/feed` became keepable
    (story 0020): a work kept while scrolling never had a day to lose. An
    owner-written string covering both cases honestly can go here later; an
    empty slot is the honest default until one does. %>
<span class="days__text">
  <% if pick %>
    <time class="days__date <%= "days__date--now" if pick == current %>"
          datetime="<%= pick.scheduled_on.iso8601 %>"><%
      %><% if pick.scheduled_on == Date.current %>Today · <% end %><%= pick.scheduled_on.to_fs(:daily) %></time>
  <% end %>
  <span class="days__title <%= "days__title--long" if painting.long_title? %>"><%= painting.title %></span>
  <span class="days__artist"><%= painting.artist_display %></span>
</span>

<span class="days__thumb">
  <%= image_tag artwork_src(painting, size: 240), alt: "",
        loading: (eager ? "eager" : "lazy"), decoding: "async" %>
</span>
